Strong to near gale force southerly breezes continue to spread
across the coastal waters. Wind driven rough to very rough seas
build Tuesday into Wednesday resulting in hazardous conditions for
small craft. Frequent gale force gusts north of Point Reyes
persist  through Tuesday afternoon. Elsewhere, occasional gale
force gusts  are likely. Moderate to heavy rainfall streams in
